  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: Stack buffer overflow in mmpstrucdata\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-61548.patch: parse RFC5424 structured-data\n       parameter values into a heap buffer sized from the remaining\n       structured data instead of a fixed 32 KiB stack buffer in\n       parseSD_PARAM() in plugins/mmpstrucdata/mmpstrucdata.c, and widen\n       the cached structured-data length lenStrucData to rs_size_t in\n       runtime/msg.h\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-61548-tests.patch: add upstream regression\n       test mmpstrucdata-large-sd.sh\n     - debian/rules: make the new test executable\n     - CVE-2026-61548",
